&lt;p&gt;This is a 12 month fixed term contract position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Dublin / Greater Dublin. Proximity to our Dublin city centre offices in D2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly organised, resourceful, and proactive Executive Assistant to provide high-level administrative and operational support to our CEO &amp;amp; COO executives. This role requires exceptional judgment, the ability to manage sensitive information, and the agility to pivot quickly in a high-growth environment. The right candidate will be a strategic partner helping to anticipate needs, streamline operations, and ensure our executive leaders can focus on driving growth and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Plan and execute major company events, including the annual Company Kick-Off and Leadership off-sites in Europe and North America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with external vendors and production agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Board &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage end to end logistics, agenda planning, and material preparation for Board meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee CEO and COO level engagements, calendar management, and complex travel coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Juggle and prioritise multiple streams of work originating from various internal teams to keep the CEO and COO office running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Team Rhythm:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the cadence, scheduling, and operational rigour of all Executive Leadership Team meetings. Drive agenda planning, track action items, and ensure accountability across the leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring with you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable taking ownership of tasks and working with a high degree of independence, while knowing when to check in and collaborate. Someone who can look around corners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrives in a dynamic environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Not everything comes with a playbook. Is able to apply good judgment and move forward confidently when the path isn&#39;t fully mapped out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experienced in dynamic, evolving environments where flexibility and resilience are part of everyday work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven EA Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience supporting C-suite executives; managing and delivering large-scale corporate events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool stack: Proficiency in a digital workplace and collaboration platforms&lt;/strong&gt; that includes Slack, Notion, Google Suite and Navan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
